+/**
+ * True when year is a leap year in the Gregorian calendar: divisible by 4, except centuries that are not divisible by
+ * 400. Years are counted astronomically, so year 0 is a leap year and so is -4 (the proleptic calendar).
+ * @param {number} year a whole number
+ * @returns {boolean}
+ * @throws {TypeError} if year is not a number
+ * @throws {RangeError} if year is not a whole number
+ */
